sequenceDiagram
    participant Web as Web server
    participant Cache
    participant DB as Database
    Web->>Cache: 1. read data
    alt cache hit
        Cache-->>Web: return data
    else cache miss
        Cache-->>Web: nil
        Web->>DB: 2.1 query
        DB-->>Web: row
        Web->>Cache: store result
        Note over Web: 2.2 return data to web server
    end
